:name: HWA10 WPP pipe
:description: Batch run with a WPP link into the firmware and no radio peer.
:  The pipe listens on 127.0.0.1:7788, framing [len u16 big-endian][payload];
:  a TCP connection stands for the BLE one. ANCS is on 127.0.0.1:7789, where
:  the pipe is the GATT server instead. Drive both with wpp-sim-client:
:    renode --disable-xwt --console -e "include @scripts/wpp-pipe.resc"
:    cargo run -p wpp-sim-client            # once out/uart0.log has "Add WPPS chars."

include @scripts/machine.resc

runMacro $fastStartup

logLevel -1 sysbus.wppPipe
emulation SetAdvanceImmediately true
sysbus.wppPipe AttachRam $ram_evt_buffer $ram_wpp_service_context $ram_pairing_record $ram_ancs_uuid_table
sysbus.wppPipe Attach $hook_ble_evt_present $hook_ble_evt_poll $hook_hvx_thunk
sysbus.wppPipe AttachAncs $hook_gattc_prim_srvc_disc_thunk $hook_gattc_char_disc_thunk $hook_gattc_desc_disc_thunk $hook_gattc_write_thunk
start
